KILLED   whole mass instead of effective mass: 10 failing checks (e.g. Stik wingtip brush in a low pass grades C0)
KILLED   absolute joules (no division by mass): 9 failing checks (e.g. Stik firm belly touch grades C1)
KILLED   sliding counted as normal energy: 9 failing checks (e.g. Stik wingtip brush in a low pass grades C0)
KILLED   abrasion not capped at C1: 4 failing checks (e.g. Stik firm belly touch grades C1)
KILLED   slapdown dropped: 4 failing checks (e.g. Avanti 45 deg dive at 20 m/s: slapdown raises it to C3)
KILLED   slapdown ignores first contact: 3 failing checks (e.g. slapdown energy is the CG normal energy left after the first contact)
KILLED   durability ignored: 1 failing checks (e.g. durability 2 halves the specific energy)
KILLED   helper drops rotational term: 2 failing checks (e.g. level wingtip matches 1/(1/m + y^2/Ixx))
KILLED   helper uses body normal un-rotated: 2 failing checks (e.g. vertical nose-in on the spinner axis engages the whole mass)
